


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_96830676:



    voice "2MI_0750"
    miyako "「不知道哪个比较好，就买了各种颜色的彩带」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_95c6d0ca:



    voice "2FU_0670"
    fumi "「其实搭配着包装纸来选就好了哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_a5bafeab:



    voice "2MI_0751"
    miyako "「如果是圣诞节的话就绿色和红色就行了，也不用这么烦恼了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_076db5a1:



    voice "2FU_0671"
    fumi "「情人节巧克力的包装可以自由发挥一切想象哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_e6c5965f:


    "购买包装材料的圣夜子和文回来了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_3b38813c:



    voice "2RI_0813"
    rin "「啊，欢迎回来」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_da5acaf3:


    "本该先回来的阳菜和伦还穿着校服。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_6cd8056e:



    voice "2FU_0672"
    fumi "「咦，怎么了么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_ec474636:



    voice "2HI_0806"
    hina "「祥子姐，似乎要辞去管理人的职务」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_b775d9e7:



    voice "2FU_0673"
    fumi "「诶！？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_453339e7:



    voice "2MI_0752"
    miyako "「这是她本人说的么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_8546f422:



    voice "2RI_0814"
    rin "「啊，嗯。虽然好像还没有决定」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_048c3312:



    voice "2HI_0807"
    hina "「和伦一同回到宿舍时，在大厅看到祥子姐和不认识的阿姨在说话」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_880ce5dd:



    voice "2HI_0808"
    hina "「听说那个阿姨是之前的管理人，因为身体不好这几年都在休假」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_f6f46246:



    voice "2RI_0815"
    rin "「祥子姐是这期间临时的管理人，所以，前管理人身体也恢复了，就来商量着复出」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_9163f879:



    voice "2FU_0674"
    fumi "「也就是说祥子姐是替代的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_2696f24f:


    "伦点了点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_06b6e1b8:



    voice "2FU_0675"
    fumi "「祥子姐就没有说她还想继续做下去么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_ed52e6bf:



    voice "2HI_0809"
    hina "「看上去像是很痛快地答应了的样子。不过我们也只是听到了一部分」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_a5a47442:



    voice "2RI_0816"
    rin "「虽然不知道合同是怎样的，不过临时工肯定说话没分量」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_2604eefd:



    voice "2FU_0676"
    fumi "「是么……但是这也太突然了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_c2cb2302:



    voice "2RI_0817"
    rin "「一开始还想做点什么的，不过我觉得应该会被她骂吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_497868e7:



    voice "2HI_0810"
    hina "「……什么都别做最好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_a8353864:


    "玩笑和吐槽都提不起劲。看来阳菜和伦都很舍不得祥子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_dba4dac4:



    voice "2MI_0753"
    miyako "「祥子姐现在在哪？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_a83020ae:


    "一直沉默不语在一旁倾听着的圣夜子开口了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_77d70d5e:



    voice "2RI_0818"
    rin "「呃，在屋顶」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_1a0c0ea9:



    voice "2MI_0754"
    miyako "「我去问问她」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_f57101f5:


    "圣夜子笑了笑，飞快地向楼梯跑去。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_3883631e:


    "三人为圣夜子的沉着而面面相觑。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_87de2764:



    voice "2HI_0811"
    hina "「即使辞去管理人也不会离开的吧？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_7caf4395:



    voice "2RI_0819"
    rin "「这种事……我也不知道啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_12_41d2b6b3:



    voice "2FU_0677"
    fumi "「……圣夜子」"
